<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.06		 40.12</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	62.60		 62.70</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.20		 26.25</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.357		 0.359</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.66		 10.68</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    10.90		 10.92</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 8.00 pct	    8.20 pct</p>
</text>
